# _NOTES: Company/Fase0_descargas_IR (Fuso Chemical primary documents)

Written 12-Oct-2026 after reading the files. Read this before opening anything here. Conventions: FY03/2026 = Apr-2025 to Mar-2026 = company "2025年度". P = PDF page. "md" = the pdf-to-markdown conversion next to each PDF.

## How to read the files (workflow lessons)
1. **Filings (yuho, tanshin, interim, notices): the md is reliable text.** Use `grep -n` on the md, then cite P. Page markers inside the md (`<!-- pagina N -->`) equal PDF pages.
2. **Slide decks: the md is NOT a number source.** Chart values lose their axis labels (example: capex on Q4 deck slide 12 comes out as loose numbers). Render the PDF page to PNG (pymupdf, zoom 1.3) and read the image, or open the bilingual PDF (see below). Use the md only to locate the slide.
3. **Japanese prevails.** Known translation trap: the English Q4 deck slide 32 says Kyoto new line certification "by the end of Mar.2025". The Japanese says 2025年度末, which is end of FY03/2026 (Mar-2026). The yuho FY03/2026 P33 confirms full operation from end FY03/2026.
4. **Fiscal-year labels:** "2025年度" = FY03/2026. MTP "2026-2030年度" = FY03/2027 to FY03/2031. "2028年度完成" = FY03/2029. File names such as "Q4 2026" mean the quarter in the FY ending Mar-2026.
5. **MTP deck: PDF page = printed slide + 1.**
6. `images/` holds 429 PNG crops made by the converter (logos, chart crops). Do not read them. `*_figuras.pdf` holds one figure per page, in the order of the `[FIG-NNN]` tags in the md.

